## 🎨 UI/UX Best Practices

### 1. Image Upload Component

```tsx
const ImageUploadField: React.FC<{
  onImageSelect: (base64: string, filename: string) => void;
}> = ({ onImageSelect }) => {
  const handleFileChange = async (e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>) => {
    const file = e.target.files?.[0];
    if (!file) return;
    
    // Validate file type
    if (!file.type.startsWith('image/')) {
      alert('Please upload an image file');
      return;
    }
    
    // Validate file size (max 5MB)
    if (file.size > 5 * 1024 * 1024) {
      alert('File size must be less than 5MB');
      return;
    }
    
    // Convert to base64
    const base64 = await fileToBase64(file);
    onImageSelect(base64, file.name);
  };
  
  return (
    <div className="image-upload">
      <label>
        <input 
          type="file" 
          accept="image/*"
          onChange={handleFileChange}
        />
        Upload Image (max 5MB)
      </label>
    </div>
  );
};
```

### 2. Image Preview

```tsx
const ImagePreview: React.FC<{ 
  imageUrl: string;
  onRemove?: () => void;
}> = ({ imageUrl, onRemove }) => {
  return (
    <div className="image-preview">
      <img src={imageUrl} alt="Preview" />
      {onRemove && (
        <button onClick={onRemove} className="remove-btn">
          ✕ Remove
        </button>
      )}
    </div>
  );
};
```

### 3. Edit Question Form

```tsx
const QuestionEditForm: React.FC<{ questionId?: number }> = ({ questionId }) => {
  const [formData, setFormData] = useState({
    questionText: '',
    imageBase64: '',
    imageOriginalName: ''
  });
  const [existingImage, setExistingImage] = useState<any>(null);
  
  // Load existing question
  useEffect(() => {
    if (questionId) {
      fetch(`/api/questions/${questionId}`)
        .then(res => res.json())
        .then(data => {
          setFormData({
            questionText: data.questionText,
            imageBase64: '',
            imageOriginalName: ''
          });
          if (data.images?.length > 0) {
            setExistingImage(data.images[0]);
          }
        });
    }
  }, [questionId]);
  
  const handleSubmit = async () => {
    const payload: any = {
      questionText: formData.questionText,
      // ... other fields
    };
    
    // Only include image if new image selected
    if (formData.imageBase64) {
      payload.imageBase64 = formData.imageBase64;
      payload.imageOriginalName = formData.imageOriginalName;
    }
    
    const url = questionId 
      ? `/api/questions/${questionId}` 
      : '/api/questions';
    
    const response = await fetch(url, {
      method: questionId ? 'PUT' : 'POST',
      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
      body: JSON.stringify(payload)
    });
    
    return await response.json();
  };
  
  return (
    <form onSubmit={(e) => { e.preventDefault(); handleSubmit(); }}>
      <input 
        value={formData.questionText}
        onChange={e => setFormData({...formData, questionText: e.target.value})}
        placeholder="Question text"
      />
      
      {/* Show existing image or new upload */}
      {existingImage && !formData.imageBase64 ? (
        <ImagePreview 
          imageUrl={existingImage.filePath}
          onRemove={() => setExistingImage(null)}
        />
      ) : formData.imageBase64 ? (
        <ImagePreview 
          imageUrl={formData.imageBase64}
          onRemove={() => setFormData({...formData, imageBase64: ''})}
        />
      ) : (
        <ImageUploadField
          onImageSelect={(base64, filename) => 
            setFormData({...formData, imageBase64: base64, imageOriginalName: filename})
          }
        />
      )}
      
      <button type="submit">Save Question</button>
    </form>
  );
};
```

---

## ⚠️ Important Notes

### File Size Limits
- **Maximum**: 5MB per image
- Backend akan reject jika lebih besar
- Compress image sebelum upload jika perlu

### Supported Formats
- ✅ JPEG (.jpg, .jpeg)
- ✅ PNG (.png)
- ✅ GIF (.gif)
- ✅ WebP (.webp)

### Image URLs
- **JANGAN** simpan atau hardcode R2 URL langsung
- **SELALU** gunakan `filePath` dari response backend
- Backend URL format: `http://backend.com/api/files/{objectKey}`
- R2 bucket adalah **private**, hanya accessible via backend

### Caching
- Backend set cache header: `Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable`
- Browser akan cache image selama 1 tahun
- Tidak perlu implement caching di frontend

---

## 🚀 Testing

### Manual Test
1. Upload image via create question
2. Verify image muncul di question list
3. Edit question, upload image baru
4. Verify image lama ter-replace
5. Display question di public quiz
6. Verify image muncul saat quiz taking
7. Verify image muncul di quiz results

### Example Test Data
```typescript
const testImageBase64 = "data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mP8z8DwHwAFBQIAX8jx0gAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==";
// Small red pixel, perfect for testing
```

---

## 📞 Backend Endpoints Summary

| Method | Endpoint | Purpose | Request | Response |
|--------|----------|---------|---------|----------|
| POST | `/api/questions` | Create question with image | `imageBase64`, `imageOriginalName` | Question with `images[]` |
| PUT | `/api/questions/:id` | Update question (replace image) | `imageBase64`, `imageOriginalName` | Question with `images[]` |
| GET | `/api/questions/:id` | Get question with images | - | Question with `images[]` |
| GET | `/api/questions?quizId=X` | Get all questions for quiz | - | Questions with `images[]` |
| GET | `/api/public/quiz/:token` | Public quiz access | - | Quiz with questions + `images[]` |
| GET | `/api/files/:objectKey` | Serve image file | - | Image binary (proxied from R2) |

---

## 💡 Tips

1. **Lazy Loading**: Gunakan `loading="lazy"` pada `<img>` tag
2. **Alt Text**: Selalu provide alt text untuk accessibility
3. **Error Handling**: Handle missing images gracefully
4. **Compression**: Compress images sebelum upload untuk performa lebih baik
5. **Preview**: Show preview sebelum submit untuk user confirmation

Happy coding! 🎉
